!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!
!
! Instruction file for pgen (LLVM IR target)
!
! The target specific modules (registers, endian) are found here, the shared
! modules (independent) one level up, and the common library above that. The
! machine parameter block comes from source/mpb64, the 64 bit model, unless
! the command line names another first: the 32 bit model generator
! (pgen_llvm32) is this same source built with -mp=source/mpb32, the
! command line module path being searched before these.
!
!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!

modulepath "..;../..;../../mpb64"
